	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element max-360" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<h1>Meeting rooms</h1>
<p>Meeting space rental for up to 18 persons is available at hourly or daily rates. Our meeting room hire are suitable for meetings, coaching sessions, workshops, training or any activity, in downtown Budapest, close to everything and everyone.</p>

		</div>
